199: static SDL_Surface* Create_SDL_Surface_From_CGImage_RGB(CGImageRef image_ref)
200: {
201:     /* This code is adapted from Apple's Documentation found here:
202:      * http://developer.apple.com/documentation/GraphicsImaging/Conceptual/OpenGL-MacProgGuide/index.html
203:      * http://developer.apple.com/documentation/GraphicsImaging/Conceptual/OpenGL-MacProgGuide/opengl_texturedata/chapter_10_section_5.html
204:      * Creating a Texture from a Quartz Image Source
205:      * Listing 9-4  Using a Quartz image as a texture source.
206:      *
207:      * Unfortunately, this guide doesn't show what to do about
208:      * non-RGBA image formats so I'm making the rest up.
209:      * All this code should be scrutinized.
